Petersburg. 4202 E. Fowler Avenue Tampa, FL 33612, USA 813-974-2970 About USF Academics Admissions Locations Campus Life Research Administrative Units Regulations & Policies Human Resources Work at USF Emergency & Safety Title IX USF Health USF Athletics USF Alumni Support USF USF Libraries USF World Copyright © 2026, University of South Florida. All rights reserved. This website is maintained by Human Resources . About This Site Contact USF Visit USF Accessibility"
