    "https://www.usf.edu/work-at-usf/careers/accepted-offer.aspx": {
      "title": "Welcome",
      "description": "Welcome Skip to Main Content University of South Florida - 70 Est. 1956 University of South Florida - 70 Est. 1956 Search Search USF: Work at USF Central Human Resources Quick Links Recruitment Home Student Employment USF State Retiree Reemployment Applicant Toolkit Regulatory Information Benefits and Perks Contact Recruitment Accepted an Offer - Next Steps How to Apply Applicant Toolkit Accepted an Offer? Quick Links Visit USF Parking Permits Activate USF NetID Fall Academic Calendar BullTracker® USF Athletics Student Tickets St. Petersburg Campus USF Health Give Search MyUSF Apply Quick Links Visit USF Parking Permits Activate USF NetID Fall Academic Calendar BullTracker® USF Athletics Student Tickets St. Petersburg Campus USF Health Give Search Search USF: MyUSF Apply Work at USF Central Human Resources Quick Links Recruitment Home Student Employment USF State Retiree Reemployment Applicant Toolkit Regulatory Information Benefits and Perks Contact Recruitment Accepted an Offer - Next Steps How to Apply Applicant Toolkit Accepted an Offer? Welcome Breadcrumb Navigation Work at USF Careers Welcome Book of Bull Welcome to the most exciting time to be a Bull! Click here to access our \"Getting Started\" information as provided by the Learning & Talent Development team. Here, you'll find information\n                  about orientation, benefits, campuses, parking, our RightStart process, information\n                  for foreign nationals, new hires and rehires and more! Want to know more about being a Bull? The Book of Bull is the official guide for USF Bulls. It contains everything you\n                  need to know about the traditions of the University of South Florida. You’ll learn\n                  what it means to be a Bull, more about USF’s history, spirit, academics, annual events\n                  and alumni. Thank you to the USF Alumni Association for providing this wonderful resource! Access a digital copy of the Book of Bull here. University of South Florida Located in Tampa and St. Petersburg. 4202 E. Fowler Avenue Tampa, FL 33612, USA 813-974-2970 About USF Academics Admissions Locations Campus Life Research Administrative Units Regulations & Policies Human Resources Work at USF Emergency & Safety Title IX USF Health USF Athletics USF Alumni Support USF USF Libraries USF World Copyright © 2026, University of South Florida. All rights reserved. This website is maintained by Human Resources . About This Site Contact USF Visit USF Accessibility"
    },
